orrow</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她不困在过去 也不担心明天</span></p><p begin="21.478" end="25.550" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.478" end="21.745">She&apos;s</span> <span begin="21.745" end="22.006">a</span> <span begin="22.006" end="22.698">lover,</span> <span begin="22.698" end="23.036">a</span> <span begin="23.036" end="23.898">mother,</span> <span begin="23.898" end="24.162">a</span> <span begin="24.162" end="24.736">sister,</span> <span begin="24.736" end="24.983">and</span> <span begin="24.983" end="25.550">wife</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她是爱人 是母亲 是姐妹 也是妻子</span></p><p begin="25.550" end="29.768" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.550" end="25.754">She</span> <span begin="25.754" end="26.087">rolls</span> <span begin="26.087" end="26.793">over</span> <span begin="26.793" end="27.133">in</span> <span begin="27.133" end="27.384">the</span> <span begin="27.384" end="28.064">morning</span> <span begin="28.064" end="28.304">to</span> <span begin="28.304" end="28.539">the</span> <span begin="28.539" end="28.865">love</span> <span begin="28.865" end="29.123">of</span> <span begin="29.123" end="29.355">her</span> <span begin="29.355" end="29.768">life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">每天早晨翻过身来 面对她生命中的挚爱</span></p><p begin="29.768" end="34.469" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.768" end="30.326">Only</span> <span begin="30.326" end="30.827">smokes</span> <span begin="30.827" end="31.120">one</span> <span begin="31.120" end="31.401">on</span> <span begin="31.401" end="32.491">vacation,</span> <span begin="32.491" end="33.082">says</span> <span begin="33.083" end="33.292">just</span> <span begin="33.292" end="33.536">what</span> <span begin="33.537" end="33.833">she</span> <span begin="33.833" end="34.469">thinks</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只有度假时才抽一根烟 她想到什么就说什么</span></p><p begin="34.469" end="38.961" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begi